    for(let i=0;i<=seg;i++){cv.getPointAt(i/seg,c);const r=typeof rf==='function'?rf(i/seg):rf;for(let j=0;j<=rad;j++){const k=i*(rad+1)+j;v.fromBufferAttribute(P,k).sub(c).multiplyScalar(r).add(c);P.setXYZ(k,v.x,v.y,v.z)}}
