    conds:[{n:'lexical analysis',v:[120,80],r:'<b>Lexical analysis</b>: comments and whitespace removed · source split into <b>tokens</b>: identifier x, operator =, identifier a, operator +, … · identifiers stored in the <b>symbol table</b> (name, type, scope, address) · lexical errors: illegal characters or malformed identifiers'},{n:'syntax analysis',v:[120,80],r:'<b>Syntax analysis (parsing)</b>: tokens checked against the grammar (e.g. defined in BNF) · builds an <b>abstract syntax tree</b> showing structure and precedence (multiplication before addition) · reports syntax errors with line numbers · <b>semantic analysis</b>: type checking, undeclared variables'},{n:'code generation',v:[120,80],r:'<b>Code generation</b>: the tree is converted into object code (machine code) for the target processor: LDA b · MUL #2 · ADD a · STA x · registers and memory addresses allocated'},{n:'optimisation',v:[120,80],r:'<b>Optimisation</b>: removes redundant or unreachable code, replaces slow operations with faster ones (multiply by 2 → shift left), evaluates constants at compile time, keeps values in registers · faster, smaller programs (bars, bytes) · then <b>linking</b> with libraries and <b>loading</b> into memory'}],
