    conds:[{n:'editor features',v:[40,10],r:'<b>Editor</b>: syntax highlighting (keywords, strings, comments in different colours), auto-indentation, auto-completion/IntelliSense, bracket matching, line numbers, code folding, find and replace · speeds up writing and reduces typos'},{n:'error diagnostics',v:[40,10],r:'<b>Diagnostics</b>: syntax errors underlined as you type; translator error messages with line numbers (e.g. NameError: totl on line 4 — a typo) · linting warns about style issues and suspicious code'},{n:'debugging tools',v:[40,10],r:'<b>Breakpoints</b>: pause execution at a chosen line · <b>stepping</b>: step into/over/out one line at a time · <b>watch window/variable inspector</b>: shows values as they change (total = 3, i = 2) · <b>call stack</b> · find <b>logic errors</b> that don’t stop the program but give wrong results · bars: minutes to find a bug'},{n:'run-time and extras',v:[40,10],r:'<b>Run-time environment</b>: run the program inside the IDE and view output/console · built-in compiler/interpreter · <b>extras</b>: version control (Git), unit-test runners, refactoring (rename everywhere), GUI designers, package managers · examples: VS Code, IDLE, PyCharm, Visual Studio'}],
