    conds:[{n:'variables, constants and types',v:[1,3,6,10],r:'<b>Variable</b>: named memory location, value can change (score ← 42) · <b>constant</b>: fixed while running (PI = 3.14) — clearer, change once · <b>types</b>: integer (42), real/float (3.5), Boolean (True), character (\'A\'), string ("Ada") · casting: int("42") · choose types to save memory and prevent errors'},{n:'sequence and operators',v:[1,3,6,10],r:'<b>Sequence</b>: statements run in order · <b>arithmetic</b>: + − * / , DIV (17 DIV 5 = 3), MOD (17 MOD 5 = 2), ^ power · <b>comparison</b>: = ≠ < > ≤ ≥ · <b>Boolean</b>: AND, OR, NOT · assignment ←, input and output'},{n:'selection',v:[1,3,6,10],r:'<b>Selection</b>: IF condition THEN … ELSE IF … ELSE … ENDIF · nested IFs · CASE/SWITCH for many fixed options · conditions combine comparisons with AND/OR/NOT · e.g. IF score > 5 AND attempts < 3 THEN OUTPUT "pass"'},{n:'iteration',v:[1,3,6,10],r:'<b>Count-controlled</b>: FOR i ← 1 TO 4 (known number of repeats) — running total 1, 3, 6, 10 (bars) · <b>condition-controlled</b>: WHILE (checked first — may run 0 times) and REPEAT…UNTIL / DO…WHILE (checked after — runs at least once) · avoid infinite loops; nested loops for 2D data'}],
