    conds:[{n:'functional requirements',v:[8,4,2],r:'<b>Functional</b>: what the system does — e.g. F1 add, edit and delete bookings · F2 search by date and name · F3 email confirmations · F4 admin reports · numbered so they can be traced through design, testing and evaluation'},{n:'non-functional requirements',v:[8,4,2],r:'<b>Non-functional</b>: how well it works — performance (response under 1 s), usability (new users complete a booking in under 2 minutes), accessibility (screen-reader friendly, contrast), security (hashed passwords), platform (runs on school tablets) · <b>hardware and software requirements</b> listed and justified'},{n:'success criteria',v:[8,4,2],r:'<b>Measurable success criteria</b>: specific, testable, linked to requirements — “search 10 000 records in under 1 s”, “all inputs validated with clear error messages”, “80% of users rate ease of use 4/5 or higher” · vague criteria (“user-friendly”, “fast”) can’t be evaluated'},{n:'limitations and agreement',v:[8,4,2],r:'<b>Limitations</b>: features out of scope (no online payments, single school only) with reasons (time, cost, legal, skills) · present the specification to the client and record their agreement/changes — this is the contract the evaluation will be judged against'}],
