    conds:[{n:'structure of the report',v:[2,2,5,2,1],r:'<b>Sections</b>: analysis (problem, stakeholders, research, requirements, success criteria) · design (decomposition, algorithms, data, UI, test plan) · development (iterations with annotated code and test evidence) · testing · evaluation · plus contents, page numbers, headings, captions, appendix with full code listing'},{n:'annotating code',v:[2,2,5,2,1],r:'<b>Annotated code</b>: explain what each section does and <b>why</b> — design decisions, problems met and how they were solved · highlight complex techniques (recursion, OOP, hashing, SQL joins) · show iterations: version 1 → error found → version 2 fixed'},{n:'time management',v:[2,2,5,2,1],r:'<b>Plan</b>: Gantt chart with milestones and deadlines (bars: weeks per stage) · build in time for testing and evaluation — the most rushed sections · weekly logbook of progress · review against the plan and adjust'},{n:'backups and integrity',v:[2,2,5,2,1],r:'<b>Version control</b> (Git commits) and regular backups to cloud and external storage — never lose work · <b>academic integrity</b>: the work must be your own; reference any library code, tutorials or AI help used, as required by the exam board · proofread before submitting'}],
